# Short links for social bios and posts. Each lands on the homepage with a ?ref=
# tag, so the visit tracker can tell Instagram from TikTok: in-app browsers there
# usually send no referrer, and without a tag those visits all look like (direct).
#
# 302, not 301: browsers cache a 301 forever, and these targets may change.
/ig  /?ref=ig  302
/tt  /?ref=tt  302
/x   /?ref=x   302
/fb  /?ref=fb  302
/li  /?ref=li  302
/yt  /?ref=yt  302

# Repo files that aren't part of the site. Pages publishes the whole repo root,
# so without these README.md and .gitignore are served as-is.
/README.md   /  301
/.gitignore  /  301
